OL,3,ATrump announces deal for Russian diesel
OL,4,Aas Zelensky calls it a gift to Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine's President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,7,Fhas condemned Donald Trump's
OL,8,Fannouncement of a deal to import
OL,9,FRussian diesel into the US.
OL,11,FZelensky called it a gift to Russian
OL,12,FPresident Vladimir Putin that amounts
OL,13,Fto "an investment in a war that must be
OL,14,Fended, not prolonged", a position
OL,15,Fquickly backed by Ukraine's European
OL,16,Fallies.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,108,105,200,300,0,100
