OL,3,ATrump announces deal for Russian diesel
OL,4,Aas Zelensky calls it a gift to Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump said Putin had agreed to release
OL,7,F300,000 tonnes of diesel immediately
OL,8,F"to the American and global
OL,9,Fmarketplace" followed by 500,000 tonnes
OL,10,Fin November and a further one million
OL,11,Fafter that.
OL,13,FIt is understood that the US Treasury
OL,14,Fis suspending sanctions on Russian
OL,15,Fdiesel exports until 7 April as part of
OL,16,Fthe deal, but other assets like those
OL,17,Fin American banks are still frozen.
